{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1498442-engulf-pyretics-changeling-the-dreaming-c20-how-it-works","id":1498442,"title":"Engulf (Pyretics) Changeling The Dreaming (C20) How it Works?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-11-30T08:43:07-08:00","id":1498442,"title":"Engulf (Pyretics) Changeling The Dreaming (C20) How it Works?","content":"Could someone explain how exactly the &quot;Engulf&quot; power of &quot;Pyretics&quot; works?<br /> And how does it differ in damage from the power &quot;Eldritch Prime&quot; from &quot;Primal&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25762-yuesidhe","name":"YueSidhe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-02T01:32:21-08:00","id":1498611,"title":"","content":"My reading is that Eldritch Prime is a sudden blast of fire (if using that element) which deals one aggravated damage per success. It's a one-and-done effect, requiring modifier Realms to affect more than one target, as usual.<br /> <br /> Engulf, meanwhile, either protects its target or damages them. As a damaging cantrip, it deals one aggravated damage per turn, but lasts one turn per success (and can spread to anything the target comes into contact with). <br /> <br /> If used protectively, the target is safe, but anything the target comes into contact with burns instead. Potentially, this could result in many more people receiving damage within the cantrip's duration.<br /> <br /> Granted, Engulf doesn't seem super powerful, especially given the high damage caused by Eldritch Prime, but its potential for damage against multiple targets, or even a whole area, is a balancing factor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}